chx:X_SharedGenesisTransaction chx:isComparedWith chx:X_Testnet4Replaces .
[] a owl:Axiom ; owl:annotatedSource chx:X_SharedGenesisTransaction ; owl:annotatedProperty chx:isComparedWith ; owl:annotatedTarget chx:X_Testnet4Replaces ; rdfs:comment "Mainnet, testnet3, signet and regtest start with the same 204-byte coinbase transaction, and testnet4 breaks the pattern with its own of 180 bytes (Shared genesis transaction; Testnet4 replaces testnet3)."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0401/ch11/research> .
chx:X_RegtestStartState chx:isFollowedBy chx:X_SignetChallengeIsMultisig .
[] a owl:Axiom ; owl:annotatedSource chx:X_RegtestStartState ; owl:annotatedProperty chx:isFollowedBy ; owl:annotatedTarget chx:X_SignetChallengeIsMultisig ; rdfs:comment "The book recommends a development pipeline: test the code on regtest, then on signet or testnet, and finally on mainnet (Pipeline order; Regtest start state; Signet challenge is a multisig)."@en ; dcterms:source <http://example.org/sen0401/ch11/research> .
chx:X_RegtestStartState chx:isFollowedBy chx:X_TestnetMinimumDifficulty .
